  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Nearly 50 asylum seekers deported under ‘one in one out’ scheme have returned to the UK",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/aug/06/asylum-seekers-deported-one-in-one-out-returned-to-uk",
      "description": "<p>Figure raises questions about deal with France despite UK ministers insisting repeat arrivals will be removed</p><p>Almost 50 asylum seekers deported using the “one in one out” scheme have been recorded as returning to the UK a second time, the Guardian has learned.</p><p>In addition to the returnees detained by the Home Office, an unknown number are believed to have arrived in the UK undetected.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/aug/06/asylum-seekers-deported-one-in-one-out-returned-to-uk\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-06T13:32:13"
    },
    {
      "title": "Norfolk police arrest two men after officers injured during unrest over asylum plans",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/aug/06/two-men-arrested-norfolk-police-injured-unrest-thetford-asylum-plans",
      "description": "<p>Homes of people believed to be asylum seekers attacked during two nights of violence in Thetford</p><p>Two men have been arrested after police were injured as they intervened to protect men believed to be asylum seekers from angry mobs trying to break into their homes.</p><p>The arrests followed two nights of unrest in Thetford, Norfolk, involving more than 100 people protesting against plans to house asylum seekers in former military barracks near the market town.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/aug/06/two-men-arrested-norfolk-police-injured-unrest-thetford-asylum-plans\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-06T18:06:14"
    }
  ]
